@startuml
title SC-ORD-008 — The same message is delivered twice
participant "Order\n(saga)" as O
participant "Inventory" as I
participant "Payment" as P
participant "Payment\nprovider" as PSP

O ->> P : ChargePayment
P -> PSP : charge
PSP --> P : captured
P ->> O : PaymentCaptured
note over O : one transaction: message recorded,\nsaga CONFIRMING_STOCK,\nConfirmReservation to send
O ->> I : ConfirmReservation
P ->> O : PaymentCaptured (duplicate)
note over O : message already recorded:\nacknowledged, nothing done
O ->> P : ChargePayment (duplicate)
note over P : a payment exists for this order:\nthe provider is not called
P ->> O : PaymentCaptured (same answer)
note over O : recorded as a new message,\nbut the saga no longer expects it: ignored
@enduml
